# Fallback discovery path for the platform adapter. The primary registration is
# explicit (AetheriumFabric#onInitializeClient -> PlatformServices.register), because
# on Fabric a ServiceLoader lookup can run before entry points and would then have to
# tolerate a partially initialised loader. Both paths are kept so that a tool that
# inspects the jar (or a unit test) can resolve the adapter without an entry point.
com.aetherium.fabric.FabricPlatformAdapter
